    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present to the market No.3 Rowan Park, Kilcarbery, Dublin 22. We are thrilled to bring to the market this immaculately presented home located on Kilcarbery Grange, Clondalkin. Upon entry you are greeting with an abundance of light, wood flooring throughout the downstairs and an alcove entry to the sitting room which truly makes this space immediately unique.Down through the hall lies the downstairs WC, further through the hallway is the spacious kitchen and dining area with high end appliances throughout. The downstairs accommodation is complete by storage area just off the kitchen.Upstairs comprises of three well sized bedrooms with the primary benefitting from an en-suite. The mood lighting in this property along with the texture of colours really gives any potential buyer a homely feel. The family bathroom completes the upstairs accommodation. To the rear of this property lies a well landscaped south west facing garden with scope of further extension without sacrificing your original garden space.\n\nFacing directly onto a green area in a quiet area, No.3 is the perfect home for any budding family.This peaceful development is home to many growing families and boasts close proximity to Clondalkin Village, with all essential amenities right on your doorstep such as bars, shops, local schools, sporting facilities and Corkagh park. Liffey Valley Shopping Centre is just a short drive away and the N7/M50 road networks and local bus/ train links make commuting and access to the City Centre easy.Call or email for details."
      },
